Body:
For now, I'm using the following workaround:

```json
"provider": {
  "openrouter": {
    "models": {
      "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro": {
        "name": "DeepSeek V4 Pro (fix)",

        "provider": {
          "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible"
        },
        "interleaved": {
          "field": "reasoning_content"
        },

        "options": {
          "provider": {
            "only": ["deepseek"],
            "allow_fallbacks": false
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
...
```
